# Ad-hoc figure dumped by interactive plotting
map_visualization.png

# Everything written under Visualizations/ is regenerated by `python main.py`.
# One representative Monte Carlo run is kept in the repository as a worked
# example of the output layout (see docs/OUTPUTS.md); all other runs are local.
Visualizations/*
!Visualizations/visualize.py
!Visualizations/20260106_142518/

